Buzz relay — vendored into maxplayerai
======================================

The code under `crates/buzz/` is a vendored subset of the Buzz communications
platform, copied so the maxplayerai project can own, build, and deploy the
events + git + payments relay directly.

    Upstream:  github.com/block/buzz
    Branch:    main
    Commit:    30873ba46b5e08602ae61a2a0592ecedd37f7289 (2026-10-11)
    License:   Apache-2.0 (see ./LICENSE)

The previous copy came from the github.com/gudnuf/buzz fork (branch
sync/upstream-recarry-2026-07-24, commit e18020a63, based on block/buzz
3bd3a014c). This copy merges upstream into it, so that fork's open-relay
changes (A below) and the Maxplayer changes (B) carry over.

